# Read Review Contract

Start review and implementation checks from [`../REVIEW.md`](../REVIEW.md), then
cross-check `README.md`, `ENV.md`, and implementation docs under `docs/` if present.

Keep local contracts and implementation docs synchronized:

- policy and review expectations: `AGENTS.md`, `REVIEW.md`
- runtime/product assumptions: `README.md`, `ENV.md`
- route behavior, permissions, and UX: corresponding files under `docs/`

If implementation changes touch any of these surfaces, update affected docs in
the same change so behavior and documentation do not drift.
